# Staff shell (.issues/169). The attendee shell (index.html) does not carry the
# scanner, admin and organizer pages; `build.sh` builds them into a second
# shell, staff-app.html, and these 200 rewrites serve it for the staff paths.
# Keep in step with STAFF_PATHS in src/staff_routes.rs
# (tests/staff_shell_split.rs checks both ways).
/staff /staff-app 200
/admin /staff-app 200
/dashboard/live /staff-app 200
/events/:id/summary /staff-app 200
/events/:id/pr-pack /staff-app 200
